# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Dávid Péter Kovács et al. (2025). MACE-OFF: Short-Range Transferable Machine Learning Force Fields for Organic Molecules.
#   Journal of the American Chemical Society. doi:10.1021/jacs.4c07099  arXiv:2312.15211v5
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2312.15211v5 (sha256 e3dd92a6cb2466f5...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 5 (Method/model). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
#
# Encoding scope: the four MACE-OFF models (23(S), 23(M), 23(L), 24(M)),
# their SPICE-based training sets, the Table 2 hyperparameters and the
# held-out test errors per test-set category (Tables S1 and S2). Each
# test-set category is a material system so that errors stay comparable
# within a category.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-kovacs2025 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Kovacs et al. (2025): MACE-OFF transferable short-range force fields for organic molecules" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-kovacs2025 .

entity:article-kovacs2025 a schema:ScholarlyArticle ;
    schema:sameAs <https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.4c07099> ;
    schema:datePublished "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
